    "q-163590": {
      "dom_id": "step-q163590",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "A particle $P$ moves along the $x$-axis. When the displacement of $P$ from the origin is $x\\,m,$ the velocity is $v\\,m/s,$ and the acceleration is ${x}^{2}\\,{m/s}^{2}.$ If $P$ has velocity $2\\,m/s$ when its displacement is $\\sqrt[3]{7}\\,m,$ find the values of $x$ for which $P$ is instantaneously at rest.",
      "worked_solution": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14273713/assets/1b474c320ec59107dd191ab4420f0d4edb1e551164d90b741338da1e0dd3b23d.png)\n\nSince the acceleration of the particle $P$ is ${x}^{2}\\,{m/s}^{2},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}={x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nUsing the fact that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}=\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2}),\n$$\n\nwe can rewrite our equation as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2})={x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nIntegrating both sides of the above equation with respect to $x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2})\\text{d}x=\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nwhich gives the general solution\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2}=\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+C.\n$$\n\nNow, since $v=2\\,m/s$ when $x=\\sqrt[3]{7}\\,m,$ we can find the value of the constant $C,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2} & =\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+C \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}(2)^{2} & =\\frac{1}{3}(\\sqrt[3]{7})^{3}+C \\\\ C & =2-\\frac{7}{3} \\\\ C & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2}=\\frac{{x}^{3}-1}{3}.\n$$\n\nFinally, the particle is instantaneously at rest when $v(x)=0\\,m/s.$ We find the displacement of the particle when instantaneously at rest by substituting $v=0$ in the equation above and solving for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2} & =\\frac{{x}^{3}-1}{3} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}(0)^{2} & =\\frac{{x}^{3}-1}{3} \\\\ {x}^{3}-1 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{3} & =1 \\\\ x & =1\\,m.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-163590-a",
