mi>C</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>C</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>C</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore,</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"160\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D463 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, the particle is instantaneously at rest when <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"161\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D463 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> We find the displacement of the particle when instantaneously at rest by substituting <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"162\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D463 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> in the equation above and solving for <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"163\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>:</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"164\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-h